    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plăcĭdĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		placidus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>mildness</i>, <i>gentleness of
			nature</i> or <i>disposition</i>, <i>placidity</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oves assumptas propter placiditatem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 1</span></i>
			; Auct. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 13, 22, 19</span></i>.</div>
